OL,3,AWiddecombe suspect charged with
OL,4,Aplanning terror act against Farage
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe man accused of murdering Ann
OL,7,FWiddecombe has also been charged with
OL,8,Fpreparing acts of terror including
OL,9,Fagainst Reform UK leader Nigel Farage.
OL,11,FCounter terror police said Joshua
OL,12,FKerry, 28, was charged on Friday with
OL,13,Fone count of preparation of terrorist
OL,14,Facts.
OL,16,FThe charge relates to activity which is
OL,17,Falleged to have taken place between May
OL,18,F2024 and July 2026.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/40
